    schema:datePosted "2026-09-12"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<p><strong>Build strategies. Shape change. Lead enterprise data transformation.</strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>The Role</strong></p> <p>We are seeking a visionary <strong>Data Strategy &amp; Advisory Leader</strong> at <strong>Managing Principal</strong> level to shape the future of data in financial services. You will lead the design, delivery, and scaling of enterprise-wide data strategies for tier-one banks, insurers, and investment firms — helping them unlock the value of their data and meet the demands of an ever-evolving regulatory and digital landscape.</p> <p>This is not just about advising — it’s about <strong>owning the transformation agenda</strong>: defining innovative propositions, leading complex consulting engagements, inspiring cross-disciplinary teams, and driving commercial growth. You’ll be at the forefront of modern data strategy, governance, analytics, and AI adoption, while mentoring the next generation of data leaders.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Design and operationalise enterprise data strategies</strong> that enable business transformation across banking, insurance, and investment sectors.</li> <li><strong>Lead high-impact consulting engagements</strong> in data governance, literacy, quality, regulatory response, and analytics-driven decision-making.</li> <li><strong>Shape new market propositions</strong> in data consulting, including the adoption of AI, advanced analytics, and cloud-based data platforms.</li> <li><strong>Drive process modernisation</strong> — from business analysis to technical design, solution implementation, and long-term optimisation.</li> <li>Build trusted<strong> senior stakeholder relationships</strong>, influencing strategic decisions and securing follow-on mandates.</li> <li><strong>Scale data capabilities</strong> across internal teams and client organisations, ensuring consistent, high-quality outcomes.</li> <li>Contribute to <strong>thought leadership</strong>, industry events, and internal innovation initiatives.</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>What We’re Looking For</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>8+ years</strong> of senior-level consulting experience in financial services, with a strong data strategy and advisory focus.</li> <li>Proven expertise across the <strong>full data lifecycle</strong>, supported by frameworks such as DAMA DMBOK, DCAM, or CDMC.</li> <li>Deep understanding of <strong>enterprise data transformation</strong> and practical experience in implementing <strong>modern data management solutions</strong>.</li> <li>Experience in <strong>business development</strong> — from proposition design to pipeline growth and client relationship management.</li> <li>Hands-on involvement in <strong>agile consulting projects</strong>, and the ability to navigate complex analytical challenges with ease.</li> <li>Strong communication and <strong>influencing skills</strong> across senior business and technical stakeholders.</li> <li><strong>Fluency in German</strong> and <strong>English</strong>&nbsp;</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Bonus Points For</strong></p> <ul> <li>Familiarity with <strong>data regulations</strong> such as BCBS 239, CCAR, Solvency II.</li> <li>Working knowledge of <strong>SQL, Python</strong>, and related data analytics methods and tools.</li> <li>Experience applying <strong>AI solutions</strong> in financial services.</li> <li>Formal certifications in <strong>data governance, architecture, or strategy</strong>.</li> <li>Background in leading large, multi-disciplinary delivery teams.</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Why Join Us</strong></p> <ul> <li>Deliver high-impact, <strong>transformational data strategies</strong> for leading financial institutions.</li> <li>Work in a <strong>collaborative, entrepreneurial culture</strong> where your ideas shape the future.</li> <li>Access <strong>continuous learning</strong>, training, and industry certifications.</li> <li>Influence not only client outcomes but also the <strong>strategic direction</strong> of our data practice.</li> <li>Be part of a team that’s redefining the <strong>future of digital financial services</strong>.</li> <li>Capco’s <strong>#BeYourselfAtWork culture</strong> means we celebrate individuality and work in an environment where diverse perspectives truly drive results.</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>If you’re ready to <strong>lead transformation, challenge the status quo, and leave a lasting impact</strong> on the financial services data landscape, we’d like to hear from you.</p> Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-capco ;
    schema:identifier "arbeitnow-data-strategy-advisory-leader-managing-principal-337349" ;
    schema:jobLocationType "ON_SITE" ;
    schema:title "Data Strategy & Advisory Leader (Managing Principal)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/capco/data-strategy-advisory-leader-managing-principal-337349> .

