    kgjobs:sourceOccurrence <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/occurrence/arbeitnow-remote-senior-solutions-architect-msp-380617/1> ;
    kgjobs:sourceRecordId "remote-senior-solutions-architect-msp-380617" ;
    schema:datePosted "2026-09-12"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p>Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.</p> <p>This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you're ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.</p></div><p><strong>THE ROLE</strong></p> <p>Everpure is building a global practice for Managed Service Providers from zero: The program, the proposition, and the wins that prove it out. As Senior Solutions Architect, MSP, you're the technical front line: helping define how Everpure goes to market with MSPs, then taking that straight to the field to win deals. You'll work shoulder-to-shoulder with MSP architects and their end customers, fluent in cost-per-tenant economics one minute and whiteboarding architecture the next. There's no playbook yet; you'll be building it and proving it, deal by deal.</p> <p><strong>WHAT YOU'LL DO</strong></p> <ul> <li>Own technical leadership of MSP opportunities end to end: discovery, solution design, sizing, competitive positioning, POCs and technical close.</li> <li>Define the end-to-end service architecture — multi-tenancy, automation, provisioning, operational model and integration into the MSP's existing stack.</li> <li>Model and influence the commercial construct: unit economics, cost per tenant, Evergreen//One and consumption models.</li> <li>Displace competitors in MSP environments and position the full platform — FlashArray, FlashBlade, Portworx and Everpure Data Intelligence.</li> <li>Build technical credibility with MSP architects, practice leads and CTOs, growing a population of partner-side technical champions.</li> <li>Feed real MSP requirements back into the global MSP programme and Product Management, contributing reusable IP — reference architectures, sizing guides, service blueprints — from live engagements.</li> <li>We are primarily an in-office environment and therefore, you will be expected to work from the London office in compliance with Pure's policies, unless you are on PTO, or work travel, or other approved leave.</li> </ul> <p><strong>WHAT YOU BRING</strong></p> <ul> <li>5+ years in pre-sales, solutions architecture or technical leadership, with a demonstrable record of winning partner-led business.</li> <li>Direct experience with MSPs, with a real understanding of how they build, price, operate and sell a managed service.</li> <li>Credible at depth across modern data platform architecture: block, file and object, hybrid and cloud data services, Kubernetes and storage-as-a-service models.</li> <li>Commercial fluency — comfortable discussing consumption economics, TCO and margin with an MSP's finance and practice leadership.</li> <li>Outstanding written, diagrammatic and verbal communication, with the executive presence to move between a CTO conversation and a whiteboard session.</li> <li>Entrepreneurial and ambitious — comfortable building a practice rather than inheriting one.</li> </ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><p><strong>WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong>Innovation</strong>: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.</li> <li><strong>Growth</strong>: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune's Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune's Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!</li> <li><strong>Team</strong>: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.</li> </ul> <p>And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out <a href=\"http://purebenefits.com\">purebenefits.com</a> for more information.</p> <p><strong>ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:</strong></p> <p>Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at <a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.</p> <p><strong>OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:</strong></p> <p>We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.</p> <p>Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.</p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Join us and bring your best.</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Bring your bold.</strong></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Pure and simple.</strong></p></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-purestorage ;
