    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><h3 id=\"isPasted\"><strong>Company Overview</strong></h3> <p>Metrea delivers effects-as-a-service to national security partners across five domains and more than a dozen mission areas. These include airborne ISR, electronic warfare, secure communications, aerial refueling, special air missions, aerial firefighting, and advanced simulation. We own the whole stack: designing, building, and operating turnkey capabilities that give our partners decisive, asymmetric advantage against rapidly evolving threats.</p> <p>Our operating model is built around three interlocking pillars. The Support Groups provide a global shared-service – spanning people, finance, platform, operations, legal, and engagement. This frees up our Core Groups, who develop and own mission capabilities end-to-end, to focus entirely on delivery. The Market Groups apply a regional lens, ensuring that our agile and adaptable capabilities remain aligned to the wicked problems that matter most to our partners across the Americas, EMEA, and Asia-Pacific.</p> <p>At the heart of our model is a simple but powerful idea: be a true partner with skin in the game. Our partners need effects, not just equipment. By owning the full stack – from the lab to the field – we are able to drive a continuous cycle of innovation that keeps our partners ahead. It's a fast-moving, intellectually demanding environment where talented people are given real responsibility, work on problems that matter, and contribute to an enterprise that is growing quickly and deliberately.</p> <p>Headquartered in Washington, DC, with facilities across the United States, the United Kingdom, as well as Continental Europe and Asia-Pacific.</p></div><h3><strong>Group Overview</strong></h3> <p>This role sits within the Digital and Synthetic Group (D&amp;S). The D&amp;S Group is committed to providing mission-driven information solutions that seamlessly bridge the digital and physical realms. Leveraging cutting-edge technologies and advanced platforms, we empower operational readiness and elevate situational awareness across diverse domains—including air, maritime, and space. &nbsp;</p> <h3><strong>Position Summary</strong></h3> <p>Metrea is seeking a dynamic, curious, and highly-motivated Staff QA Engineer to join our software development team, building software solutions that provide geospatial data processing and visualisations. Candidates should have strong experience with the software development lifecycle, and extensive skills and knowledge in quality engineering. The position involves helping to drive product delivery, in collaboration with Product Managers, Software Engineers and other QA Engineers.&nbsp;</p> <p>Metrea is a people-first organisation and candidates should have strong communication skills and a desire to proactively elevate their team through continuous knowledge sharing, collaboration, feedback, and mentorship.</p> <h3><strong>What You'll Do</strong></h3> <ul> <li data-section-id=\"vpr25u\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"74\">Assist the team with refinement of user stories, through a testing lens</li> <li data-section-id=\"1brp1xx\" data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"132\">Define test strategy for complex products and projects</li> <li data-section-id=\"xl1sma\" data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"200\">Work with product and engineering to clarify acceptance criteria</li> <li data-section-id=\"9mkbj2\" data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"230\">Scope and write test cases</li> <li data-section-id=\"nnz3g9\" data-start=\"231\" data-end=\"283\">Estimate test effort associated with user stories</li> <li data-section-id=\"1aoskfw\" data-start=\"284\" data-end=\"316\">Execute manual software tests</li> <li data-section-id=\"28f4b2\" data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"368\">Help define and execute the team's test strategy</li> <li data-section-id=\"12521gt\" data-start=\"369\" data-end=\"432\">Create and maintain test plans and appropriate documentation</li> <li data-section-id=\"1hzaz1i\" data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"474\">Create and maintain automation scripts</li> <li data-section-id=\"yk8fw8\" data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"542\">Support other testers and developers with broader system testing</li> <li data-section-id=\"19n8c5s\" data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"589\">Champion Quality Engineering best practices</li> <li data-section-id=\"ryl4j0\" data-start=\"590\" data-end=\"645\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Coordinate and collaborate with Testers across teams</li> </ul> <h3><strong>What You Bring</strong></h3> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;3&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,469775450,&quot;paragraph&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;paragraph&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,134233118,&quot;true&quot;,134233117,&quot;true&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}\">Practical experience of hands-on software development and / or QA testing</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Ex</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">tensive ex</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">perience of using and testing web, windows desktop, and command line applications</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Experience leading and defining test strategy for complex products and projects</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Enthusiasm for team delivery in an Agile environment</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Drive to learn constantly and further your knowledge</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Strong organisational skills, proactive approach to task admin and docs</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Meticulous attention to detail</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Shift-left approach to testing and willingness to&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">participate</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> throughout the whole lifecycle of user stories</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Interest and ability in upskilling&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">less experienced&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">QA Engineers</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Great interpersonal skills, able to confidently communicate issues&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">confidently&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">to both technical and non-technical team members</span></span></li> </ul> <h3><strong>Additional&nbsp;Eligibility&nbsp;Qualifications</strong></h3> <div> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;3&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,469775450,&quot;paragraph&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;paragraph&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,134233118,&quot;true&quot;,134233117,&quot;true&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}\">Experience working on geospatial visualisation products</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Mixture of manual testing and automation experience</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Practical experience using Typescript</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Practical experience using Playwright</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Practical experience of BDD processes</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Knowledge of git and source control strategies</span></span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Familiarity with the Azure DevOps platform</span></span></li> </ul> </div> <h3><strong>Benefits</strong></h3> <ul> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\" data-ccp-parastyle-defn=\"{&quot;ObjectId&quot;:&quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&quot;,&quot;ClassId&quot;:1073872969,&quot;Properties&quot;:[201342446,&quot;1&quot;,201342447,&quot;5&quot;,201342448,&quot;3&quot;,201342449,&quot;1&quot;,469777841,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777842,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777843,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,469777844,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,201341986,&quot;1&quot;,469769226,&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,268442635,&quot;24&quot;,469775450,&quot;paragraph&quot;,201340122,&quot;2&quot;,134233614,&quot;true&quot;,469778129,&quot;paragraph&quot;,335572020,&quot;1&quot;,134233118,&quot;true&quot;,134233117,&quot;true&quot;,469778324,&quot;Normal&quot;]}\">Private Medical Insurance</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:288}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Subsided gym membership / plans through</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Wellhub</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:288}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Electric Car scheme</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:288}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Cycle to work scheme</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:288}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Free lunch on office days</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:288}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Enhanced Parental Leave</span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:288}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">30 days annual PTO plus b/h </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:288}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Bonus Scheme</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\"> </span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:288}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">Personal development&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-parastyle=\"paragraph\">opportunities</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:288}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <h3><strong>Work&nbsp;Authorization&nbsp;/&nbsp;Security&nbsp;Clearance</strong></h3> <p>The employee will have the legal right to work in the UK and will be able to produce right to work documentation. &nbsp;</p> <h3><strong>AAP/EEO Statement</strong></h3> <p>Metrea is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Employment decisions are made without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, or other characteristics protected by law. &nbsp;</p> <h3><strong>Position&nbsp;Type&nbsp;and&nbsp;Expected&nbsp;Hours&nbsp;of&nbsp;Work</strong></h3> <p>This is a full-time non-exempt position with typical working hours of Monday through Friday, 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. Hours and work shifts may change in accordance with department and business needs. &nbsp;</p> <h3><strong>Work&nbsp;Environment</strong></h3> <p>This job operates in an office setting.&nbsp;</p> <h3><strong>Travel</strong></h3> <p>Some travel to other Metrea offices will be required. &nbsp;</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h3><strong>Our Firmware</strong></h3> <p>At Metrea, our single core value is Rooted in Humility, and our four cornerstone attributes are Entrepreneurial, Systematic, Discerning, and Over-Deliver. These form what we call our Teammate Firmware. Just like technical firmware connects software and hardware, our Firmware is the constant interface between our mission and our people. It defines how we show up, how we work together, and how we solve complex problems.</p> <p>Our team Firmware creates a web-like, hyper-collaborative, dynamically hierarchical way of working that helps us adapt quickly, communicate openly, and distribute decision-making to where expertise actually lives. It enables groups to self-organize around hard problems, shift fluidly as priorities evolve, and operate with the trust, curiosity, and discipline required in a complex mission space. This foundation allows us to deliver elegant, effective solutions and uphold our purpose: protecting our precious inheritance.</p></div> Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
