    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><h4><strong>Who We Are</strong></h4> <p>WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.</p></div><p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Stage de fin d’études –&nbsp;Consultant·e&nbsp;Développeur·se&nbsp;MarTech</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Le développement, la data et les technologies marketing vous intéressent ? Vous souhaitez mettre vos compétences techniques au service de projets concrets et découvrir le monde du conseil ? Rejoignez-nous !</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Au sein de notre pôle&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Technology&nbsp;&amp; Digital</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, nous accompagnons nos clients – acteurs de référence dans les secteurs du&nbsp;retail, de la banque, de l’assurance, du luxe ou encore de l’hospitality&nbsp;– dans la mise en œuvre, la migration et l’optimisation de leurs plateformes&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Marketing&nbsp;Technology, CRM et E-commerce</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Nous recherchons&nbsp;un·e&nbsp;stagiaire de fin d’études, avec une perspective de pré-embauche, pour rejoindre nos équipes et développer progressivement une expertise technique et fonctionnelle sur les environnements&nbsp;MarTech.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ton rôle</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">En tant que&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Consultant·e&nbsp;Développeur·se&nbsp;MarTech</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, tu participeras à des projets d’intégration, de migration et d’évolution de solutions marketing et CRM.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Au quotidien, tu pourras être&nbsp;amené·e&nbsp;à :</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Participer à la conception et au développement de&nbsp;flux de données entre différentes plateformes marketing, CRM et systèmes tiers.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Contribuer à la mise en œuvre et au paramétrage de solutions&nbsp;MarTech.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Manipuler et analyser des données afin de garantir la qualité et la fiabilité des flux.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Participer aux développements spécifiques et aux intégrations via APIs et connecteurs.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Contribuer aux phases de recette et de déploiement des solutions.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Participer aux ateliers avec les équipes&nbsp;métiers&nbsp;et techniques et contribuer à la formalisation des besoins.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"1\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Accompagner progressivement les équipes projet sur des problématiques techniques et fonctionnelles variées.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu seras&nbsp;accompagné·e&nbsp;par des consultants expérimentés et monteras progressivement en autonomie et en responsabilité.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Les technologies</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Selon les projets, tu pourras être&nbsp;amené·e&nbsp;à travailler sur différents&nbsp;environnements&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Marketing&nbsp;Technology &amp;&nbsp;CRM :</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;Adobe Campaign, Salesforce Marketing Cloud,&nbsp;Imagino, Braze, CDP,&nbsp;CEP,&nbsp;CRM…</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Technologies :</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;SQL, Java, JavaScript, HTML, Python, APIs / Web Services, bases de données et flux de données.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Pas besoin de connaître ces solutions à ton arrivée !</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;Nous recherchons avant tout de bonnes bases techniques, de la curiosité et l’envie d'apprendre.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Ton profil</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu es en dernière année d’une&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">école d’ingénieur ou d’un Master 2 en informatique, data ou domaine équivalent</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu recherches un&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">stage de fin d’études</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;avec une perspective de CDI.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu disposes de bonnes bases en&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">programmation et manipulation de données</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu maîtrises au moins un langage parmi&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">SQL,&nbsp;HTML/CSS,&nbsp;JavaScript, Python,&nbsp;Java</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu t’intéresses aux sujets liés à la&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Data, au CRM, au Marketing&nbsp;Technology&nbsp;et aux systèmes d’information</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu es&nbsp;curieux·se,&nbsp;structuré·e&nbsp;et apprécies résoudre des problématiques techniques.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu aimes travailler en équipe et tu es à l’aise pour échanger avec différents interlocuteurs.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"8\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu es à l’écoute et&nbsp;attentif·ve&nbsp;aux besoins du client.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"9\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Une bonne capacité d’analyse et une envie de comprendre les enjeux métier seront de vrais atouts.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"3\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"10\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Anglais courant</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">, indispensable pour évoluer dans un environnement international.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Pourquoi nous rejoindre ?</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;134225954&quot;:true,&quot;134225961&quot;:true,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"1\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Une&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">première expérience concrète en conseil</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;sur des projets&nbsp;MarTech&nbsp;et Data auprès de grands clients.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;134225954&quot;:true,&quot;134225961&quot;:true,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">La possibilité de monter en expertise sur des technologies Marketing Automation et CDP&nbsp;de&nbsp;référence :&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Adobe,&nbsp;Imagino,&nbsp;Braze, Salesforce</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:278,&quot;335559991&quot;:360}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;134225954&quot;:true,&quot;134225961&quot;:true,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"3\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Un environnement au croisement de la&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tech, de la Data et du Marketing</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;134225954&quot;:true,&quot;134225961&quot;:true,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"4\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Un accompagnement personnalisé par des consultants expérimentés.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;134225954&quot;:true,&quot;134225961&quot;:true,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"5\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Des opportunités de&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">formations et de certifications</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;pour développer tes compétences.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;134225954&quot;:true,&quot;134225961&quot;:true,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"6\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Une culture collaborative et un environnement international au sein&nbsp;du groupe&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">WPP</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <ul> <li data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"2\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;134225954&quot;:true,&quot;134225961&quot;:true,&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"7\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Une perspective de&nbsp;</span><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">CDI à l’issue du stage</span></strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">&nbsp;pour les profils souhaitant poursuivre l’aventure avec nous.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></li> </ul> <p><strong><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Tu souhaites mettre tes compétences techniques au service de projets marketing innovants et découvrir le conseil ? Rejoins-nous !</span></strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <p>#LI-EMEA</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><h4><strong>About WPP</strong></h4> <p class=\"p1\">WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit <a href=\"http://wpp.com/\"><span class=\"s1\">WPP.com</span></a><span class=\"s2\">.</span></p> <p><span class=\"normaltextrun\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.</span></span><span class=\"scxw176048299\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <p>When you click \"Submit Application\", this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it's a good idea to read through our <a href=\"https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy\">Recruitment Privacy Policy</a>. California residents should read our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice\">California Recruitment Privacy Notice</a>. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.</p></div> Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow" ;
