    kgjobs:sourceOccurrence <https://openknowledgegraphs.com/jobs/live/occurrence/arbeitnow-werkstudent-store-assistant-all-genders-welcome-satisfyer-geske-beauty-tech-store-hamburg-211281/1> ;
