    schema:description "Your mission As our Working Student Brand Ambassador, you bring Mushroots directly to the people. Our products sit in the premium segment, and first-time buyers need to taste them before they commit. You make that happen — at supermarkets, festivals, trade fairs, and on our sampling bike across Hamburg. Plan and coordinate tastings with supermarkets, festivals, and trade fairs independently Run tastings end-to-end: set up the stand, engage with customers, break down, and clean all equipment Take the Mushroots sampling bike to high-traffic spots in Hamburg and create hands-on brand experiences Track and share feedback from tastings to help the team understand what resonates with customers Your profile Currently enrolled at a university (any field of study) German C1, English B2 or above You enjoy approaching people you've never met and starting a conversation Self-starter who plans, coordinates, and executes without needing step-by-step guidance Valid driver's license (Class B) Comfortable with a physical role: carrying equipment, standing for extended periods, cycling the sampling bike Previous experience as a promoter or in event sampling is a plus, not a requirement Available to occasionally work on weekends when tastings call for it Genuine interest in Mushroots products and what Infinite Roots stands for Our Benefits: Dynamic and diverse mission-driven team from more than 20 different countries A fast growing company with opportunities for personal development Flexible working hours with entitled Home Office days in an innovative and agile working environment Gym Membership, language classes or an attractive alternative from our benefit program Flat hierarchies and short decision paths Great team events such as “lunch & learn”, “Demo Day”, cultural celebrations and food tastings Drinks, cereal bar and fresh fruit at the office, our home products tasting session for new employees Lastly, join us in the journey as we change the food system as we know it! We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status. Ready to disrupt the food system with us? Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:employmentType "Part time, Student, Working student" ;
