    schema:description "Tiger Analytics is a fast-growing advanced analytics consulting firm. Our consultants bring deep expertise in Data Science, Machine Learning and AI. We are the trusted analytics partner for several Fortune 100 companies, enabling them to generate business value from data. Our business value and leadership has been recognized by various market research firms, including Forrester and Gartner. We are looking for top-notch talent as we continue to build the best analytics global consulting team in the world. Tiger Analytics is seeking an entrepreneurial technology executive to join as Tech Partner. This is a high-visibility, portfolio-level leadership role designed for a visionary who wants to co-author the Data & AI strategies for Fortune 500 enterprises, drive multi-million-dollar transformations, and shape a rapidly growing global practice. Core Mandate Strategic Client Partnership: Act as a trusted advisor to C-suite and senior enterprise stakeholders, translating complex business goals into scalable Data & AI roadmaps. Architectural Governance: Oversee technical strategy and execution across a portfolio of complex engagements, championing modern data stacks, Semantic technologies, and advanced AI/ML. Practice & Revenue Growth: Drive pre-sales and strategic solutioning to win high-value engagements, while scaling and mentoring a world-class engineering and data science team. Requirements Ideal Candidate Profile Experience: Progressive leadership spanning Enterprise Architecture, Data Engineering, and AI/ML initiatives. Technical Gravitas: Deep expertise in cloud data architecture, data modeling, semantic web, and production-grade AI systems. Executive Influence: Proven ability to command a room, manage senior stakeholder dynamics, and steer multi-million-dollar technology programs. The DNA: A blend of technical brilliance, commercial acumen, and an entrepreneurial mindset. The Pitch: This role offers the autonomy of an entrepreneurial venture with the backing, scale, and data playground of a global powerhouse. You won't just deliver projects; you will define how industries leverage data. Benefits Significant career development opportunities exist as the company grows. The position offers a unique opportunity to be part of a small, fast-growing, challenging, and entrepreneurial environment, with a high degree of individual responsibility. Tiger Analytics provides equal employment opportunities to applicants and employees without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis as protected by federal, state, or local law. Originally posted on Himalayas" ;
